<figure class="figure">
  <figcaption class="figure-head">Architecture, as built</figcaption>
  <div class="figure-body">
  <svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 960 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="dg-a2v-t dg-a2v-d">
    <title id="dg-a2v-t">Account behavior embeddings architecture</title>
    <desc id="dg-a2v-d">Storage-service telemetry (about 100 raw metrics per account) becomes a versioned feature matrix of 40 to 50 rolling features. An autoencoder trained at fleet scale produces one embedding per account, pooled to subscription and customer tiers. One shared representation feeds similarity search, anomaly detection, forecasting, LLM reasoning, and the customer-health agents, with drift, coverage, and staleness monitoring around all of it.</desc>
