  <ol class="flow-text" aria-hidden="true">
    <li><strong>Storage telemetry</strong> — ~100 raw metrics per account.</li>
    <li><strong>Feature matrix</strong> — 40–50 rolling features (transactions, capacity, auth, latency), versioned and governed.</li>
    <li><strong>Autoencoder</strong> — PyTorch on Azure Synapse, trained across millions of accounts.</li>
    <li><strong>Three tiers</strong> — one embedding per account, pooled to subscription and customer.</li>
    <li><strong>Consumers</strong> — similarity, anomaly detection, forecasting, LLM reasoning, the customer-health agents.</li>
  </ol>
